alse,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/pulls/4770","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/pull/4770","diff_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/pull/4770.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/pull/4770.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Bug fix: yes\nFeature addition: no\nBackwards compatibility break: no\nSymfony2 tests pass: [![Build Status](https://secure.travis-ci.org/gajdaw/symfony.png?branch=profile_index_unique_test)](http://travis-ci.org/gajdaw/symfony)\nFixes the following tickets: #4719\nTodo: -\nLicense of the code: MIT\nDocumentation PR: -\n\nWhen we store profile multiple times:\n\n```\n->write($profile1);\n->write($profile1);\n->write($profile1);\n\n->write($profile2);\n->write($profile2);\n->write($profile2);\n```\n\nit is duplicated in the index. Next search restricted to 2 items :\n\n```\n->find('', '', 2)\n```\n\nreturns only one item. The reason is that each duplicate decreases counter of returned items.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/4770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/4770/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/comments/6801350","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/4719#issuecomment-6801350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/4719","id":6801350,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY4MDEzNTA=","user":{"login":"gajdaw","id":676675,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjY3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/676675?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gajdaw","html_url":"https://github.com/gajdaw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gajdaw/followers","following_url":"https